# robotsix-linkedin — local development
#
# Configuration is loaded from config/config.json (the single source of
# truth). Edit that file directly or use the Settings API:
#
#   GET  /config          — view current config (secrets masked)
#   PUT  /config          — update config fields
#   GET  /config/schema   — JSON Schema for the config model
#
# For local development, copy config/config.json and fill in your
# LinkedIn app credentials. NEVER commit real secrets to the repository.
#
# The config file path can be overridden with ROBOTSIX_CONFIG_FILE
# (default: config/config.json).
